			<div class="content" id="post-content-3612368">
									

<p>Just a couple of nitpicks with the article.</p>
<p>First, the disinformation campaign is Men-in-Black levels of bullshitting. Something like that would in all likelihood just draw more attention to the SCP, rather than deflect attention.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>“Go raibh maith agat le haghaidh ag tabhairt uirthi baile”.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>My Irish is rusty, but a better translation would be &quot;Go raibh maith agat as í a thabhairt abhaile.&quot; Luckily, Irish is fluid enough that your translation can slide.</p>
<p>Other than that, I'm a complete sucker for articles inspired by my home country's myths. +1</p>

